OL,3,AI won't accept exclusion within Green
OL,4,AParty, says Polanski after criticism of
OL,5,AZionism motion
OL,6,
OL,7,FZack Polanski has said he will not
OL,8,Faccept anyone being excluded from the
OL,9,FGreen Party "because of the religious
OL,10,For communal body they are part of",
OL,11,Fafter members adopted a motion
OL,12,Fdeclaring Zionism a form of racism.
OL,14,FThe Green leader said "no-one will be
OL,15,Fmade unwelcome because of their
OL,16,Fbackground, their faith, or where they
OL,17,Fworship".
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
